{
  "source": "course-assets/your-home-base/your-home-base.mp4",
  "duration": 190.1013125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.76,
      "text": "When you sit down to use AI, your first decision is which app to open."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.44,
      "end": 12.42,
      "text": "Three names you'll hear constantly are ChatGPT from OpenAI, Claude from Anthropic, and Gemini from Google."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.08,
      "end": 16.1,
      "text": "All three can chat, write code, and answer questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.64,
      "end": 21.04,
      "text": "So if they all do essentially the same things, why does it matter which one you pick?"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.78,
      "end": 23.28,
      "text": "Think about it like a burger place."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.94,
      "end": 28.02,
      "text": "In-N-Out and McDonald's both build cheeseburgers from roughly the same ingredients."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.02,
      "end": 33.26,
      "text": "Yet, they provide completely different experiences because each company operates on a different"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.26,
      "end": 35.04,
      "text": "idea of what a restaurant should be."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.64,
      "end": 39.26,
      "text": "One focuses on a tiny menu with everything made fresh to order."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.72,
      "end": 44.78,
      "text": "The other is engineered for maximum speed, massive scale, and being exactly identical"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.78,
      "end": 46.18,
      "text": "in every city on Earth."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.86,
      "end": 49.1,
      "text": "The big three AI apps work the same way."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.48,
      "end": 52.7,
      "text": "They all rely on AI models that learn patterns during training."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.0,
      "end": 57.62,
      "text": "But each company makes distinct choices about how to train those models, what to build"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.62,
      "end": 60.68,
      "text": "into their app and how the system acts when it isn't sure."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.22,
      "end": 64.1,
      "text": "Those choices determine how each app feels,"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.58,
      "end": 67.78,
      "text": "what specific tasks it excels at, and how it behaves."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.46,
      "end": 71.06,
      "text": "This board breaks down the big three side by side."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.66,
      "end": 74.46,
      "text": "We can think of ChatGPT as the anything box."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.8,
      "end": 77.36,
      "text": "It acts as one general purpose AI app"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.36,
      "end": 79.12,
      "text": "designed for a wide range of tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.56,
      "end": 81.4,
      "text": "You ask questions, create things,"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.5,
      "end": 83.14,
      "text": "and get help with your daily work."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.82,
      "end": 86.66,
      "text": "This comes directly from OpenAI's driving question."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.66,
      "end": 89.86,
      "text": "how do we put capable AI in everyone's hands?"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.94,
      "end": 92.58,
      "text": "Claude acts as the thinking partner."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.24,
      "end": 95.08,
      "text": "It functions specifically as an assistant"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.08,
      "end": 96.66,
      "text": "for working through complex ideas"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.66,
      "end": 98.66,
      "text": "and difficult multi-step tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.44,
      "end": 101.08,
      "text": "Anthropic places a strong emphasis"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.08,
      "end": 103.0,
      "text": "on safety and predictable behavior,"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.44,
      "end": 105.76,
      "text": "asking, how do we build powerful AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.76,
      "end": 106.94,
      "text": "we can actually trust?"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.88,
      "end": 109.24,
      "text": "Gemini takes a different approach."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.32,
      "end": 112.66,
      "text": "It acts as the AI assistant built directly into Google."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.24,
      "end": 114.74,
      "text": "Its main advantage shows up"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.74,
      "end": 116.32,
      "text": "when your work connects to the Google tools"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.32,
      "end": 118.02,
      "text": "you already use on a daily basis."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.66,
      "end": 120.96,
      "text": "Google's guiding question focuses on integration."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.68,
      "end": 124.7,
      "text": "How do we put AI inside the tools people already use?"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.26,
      "end": 126.82,
      "text": "Each app has distinct strengths"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.82,
      "end": 128.62,
      "text": "born from these specific philosophies,"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.74,
      "end": 130.62,
      "text": "but you will find massive overlap"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.62,
      "end": 132.26,
      "text": "in what they can accomplish day to day."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.78,
      "end": 133.72,
      "text": "Because of this overlap,"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.02,
      "end": 136.3,
      "text": "any of the three tools will do the job for most tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.8,
      "end": 138.12,
      "text": "Do not agonize over the choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.52,
      "end": 139.92,
      "text": "There is no single best app,"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.02,
      "end": 142.26,
      "text": "and what is best today might change by next week."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.88,
      "end": 144.2,
      "text": "Claude currently requires users"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.2,
      "end": 145.58,
      "text": "to be at least 18 years old."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.58,
      "end": 149.82,
      "text": "We still cover it because knowing your options matters, even before you can access them."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.44,
      "end": 153.06,
      "text": "For this course, ChatGPT is your designated home base."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.6,
      "end": 156.5,
      "text": "Learn it deeply, its settings, its features, its quirks."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.0,
      "end": 159.74,
      "text": "Knowing one app thoroughly beats shallow dabbling in all three."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.32,
      "end": 162.12,
      "text": "Later, you can try a specific strategy."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.6,
      "end": 164.5,
      "text": "Ask a second app the exact same question."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.86,
      "end": 168.44,
      "text": "It might catch a detail the first app missed or suggest a completely different approach"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.44,
      "end": 169.08,
      "text": "to the problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.56,
      "end": 173.04,
      "text": "If the two apps disagree, you have something to investigate."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.04,
      "end": 178.6,
      "text": "But keep in mind, even if they agree perfectly, that does not guarantee they are right."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.56,
      "end": 180.5,
      "text": "Pick a home base."
    },
    {
      "start": 181.02,
      "end": 181.7,
      "text": "Learn it deeply."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.18,
      "end": 183.16,
      "text": "The skills transfer."
    },
    {
      "start": 183.72,
      "end": 185.4,
      "text": "The app is just where you practice them."
    }
  ],
